From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libaribcaption: compile its renamed private MD5 implementation

libaribcaption 6c3b4f361bc8 renamed its MD5 symbols to aribcc_md5_*.
Its header no longer redirects to OpenSSL, but HAVE_OPENSSL still excludes
the implementation in md5.c. Stop defining this obsolete switch to avoid
undefined symbols when linking FFmpeg and libmpv. OpenSSL remains enabled
for FFmpeg and the other dependencies.

diff --git a/packages/libaribcaption.cmake b/packages/libaribcaption.cmake
--- a/packages/libaribcaption.cmake
+++ b/packages/libaribcaption.cmake
@@ -20,8 +20,6 @@ ExternalProject_Add(libaribcaption
         -DARIBCC_NO_RTTI=ON
         -DARIBCC_USE_FONTCONFIG=ON
         -DARIBCC_USE_FREETYPE=ON
-        "-DCMAKE_C_FLAGS='-DHAVE_OPENSSL=1'"
-        "-DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS='-DHAVE_OPENSSL=1'"
     BUILD_COMMAND ${EXEC} ninja -C <BINARY_DIR>
     INSTALL_COMMAND ${EXEC} ninja -C <BINARY_DIR> install
     LOG_DOWNLOAD 1 LOG_UPDATE 1 LOG_CONFIGURE 1 LOG_BUILD 1 LOG_INSTALL 1
